DESCRIPTION:Define positioning: AI/ML + Reliability Engineering; production-grade AI systems. Draft 1-sentence positioning and evidence themes.\n\n30-day objective: build credible public evidence for a GDE/Googler referral. Official GDE criteria emphasize Google-technology expertise, significant developer-community contributions, clear communication, and referral by a Googler or existing GDE.
